{"id": "59bf63be-2f9f-4c02-a652-521246eb309e", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "This is a comprehensive, multi-step review involving resource discovery, CloudWatch metrics across multiple streams, quota checks, and reference documents — clearly token-inefficient for me to run directly. I'll hand this off for deep research since it's a full operational review across all pillars.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "tooluse_UBDHWehiiHn3ZlhPLq8som", "tool_name": "gather_context", "input": {"prompt": "{
  "task": "Run a comprehensive operational review of all Amazon Data Firehose delivery streams in us-east-1, following the 'firehose-operation-review' skill end to end (Steps 1-5). Cover ALL relevant pillars: Security, Reliability, Performance, Service Quotas, Cost Optimization, and note Operational Excellence/Sustainability findings where they surface naturally from the checklist, but the user explicitly asked to cover: security, reliability, delivery health, performance, cost, and service quotas.",
  "context": "User wants an operational review of their Firehose delivery streams. They explicitly want severity ratings on every finding (CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW/INFO per the skill's severity definitions). This is account 462422900361, region us-east-1, within the current AWS DevOps Agent Space (arn:aws:aidevops:us-east-1:462422900361:agentspace/7d1c7a27-fe61-40ea-8bdc-ab6443ec8b93).",
  "resources": ["all Firehose delivery streams in us-east-1", "account 462422900361"],
  "timeframe": "last 7 days (default window) ending 2026-09-24T22:30:28Z",
  "criteria": "Follow the firehose-operation-review skill: (1) discover all delivery streams via ListDeliveryStreams/DescribeDeliveryStream/ListTagsForDeliveryStream, skip non-ACTIVE streams appropriately, (2) load references/metrics-thresholds.md and pull relevant CloudWatch AWS/Firehose metrics per stream's source/destination/enabled features over the 7-day window, (3) check alarm coverage via DescribeAlarms for ThrottledRecords and DataFreshness alarms, (4) load references/best-practices-checklist.md and evaluate every applicable checklist item per stream, assigning severity per the skill's Severity Definitions table, (5) check service quotas via servicequotas.GetServiceQuota and the *PerSecondLimit metrics, (6) produce a full findings list grouped by pillar (security, reliability, performance, cost, quotas) with severity ratings, plus an executive summary. Generate the report artifact per Step 5 using the report template. Return the full findings so I can present them to the user."
}", "deep_research": true}, "type": "tool_use"}], "created_at": null}
